@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_PROVIDER_ADMIN_TOKEN
@offeringId = REPLACE_WITH_EXISTING_LOCAL_OFFERING_ID

### Read linked capabilities and hosting assignments; no receipts or mutations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/boundary-overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Page independently; totals are across all linked records, not this page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/boundary-overview?capabilityPage=2&missionPage=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invalid page size: 400 INVALID_PROVIDER_REQUEST
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/boundary-overview?pageSize=101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown/foreign offering: 404 PROVIDER_RECORD_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff/boundary-overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Missing authentication: 401; an ordinary tenant/support token must not grant provider access
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/csp/offerings/{{offeringId}}/boundary-overview
